      "pronunciationText": "Two came up seventy times out of two hundred and fifty, so P of X equals two is approximately zero point two eight. For the reason, don't just add the four estimates. Each spin lands on exactly one number, so the counts add to two hundred and fifty, and dividing by two hundred and fifty gives one. Adding the estimates to get one shows it, but it doesn't explain it."
